# Vendored BMAD skill-pack installations.
#
# BMAD's installer writes the same skill pack once per AI tool it supports.
# .agents/, .agent/ and .cline/ are byte-identical copies of .claude/, and
# .opencode/ is the same content under that tool's own naming convention
# (commands/ rather than skills/). Tracking four copies of one vendored pack
# means every upstream bump lands four times in review.
#
# .claude/ is kept as the tracked canonical copy. The rest stay on disk so the
# other tools keep working; they are just not versioned.
.agents/
.agent/
.cline/
.opencode/
